WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:12,970
Once upon a time there was a little fox

2
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:15,190
Live on the back of the moon

3
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:20,540
She sits under the silver chest tree every day

4
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:25,000
Why doesn’t the third brother have electricity?

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:34,170
When will Yoyo come find her?

6
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:36,710
Couldn't she have forgotten?

7
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:38,960
No way

8
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,120
How could she forget?
